{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14226250","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422624001:":{"text":"だから、私の話を――","source_cn":"你们先听我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB465F0747DEFEFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422624003:":{"text":"これからどうすれば……","source_cn":"以后怎么办啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1731738F455B1A10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422624002:":{"text":"お前が竜を逃がしたせいだ！","source_cn":"都怪你放走了龙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB963888449A8CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422624004:":{"text":"何もかも終わりだっ！","source_cn":"我的生活完了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5668533AD7FA558E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422624005:":{"text":"おや？ずいぶんと賑やかだねえ。","source_cn":"哦？这么热闹？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B88DF37D926378B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422625001:0":{"text":"はいはい、静かに！発言は一人ずつで頼むよ。うん、じゃあキミからどうぞ。何があったんだい？","source_cn":"诸位，诸位，安静！请依次发言，对，从你开始，有什么问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3114855CF8E80A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422625002:0":{"text":"インドラが、竜を逃がしたとか言ってたっけ？","source_cn":"我刚刚听到你质疑因度厄放走了龙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DEFEF0C4649D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422625003:0":{"text":"あ、いや……俺は、ただ、これからどうすればいいか、分からないんだよ！","source_cn":"我、我没有……我只是，呃，不知道该干什么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D0DA6E723EC16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422625004:0":{"text":"それも全部、こいつのせいだ！こいつが余計なことをしたせいで、王都入りの夢が消えちまった！","source_cn":"都怪这家伙！如果不是他搞出那么多乱七八糟的事，我还有个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15EF0FAAD82F2C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422625005:0":{"text":"なのに、地上へ行こうにも、こいつがダメだって言う……ここで死ぬのを待てってことかよ……","source_cn":"现在，想去地表上这家伙又不让……在这里怕不是在等死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5DED3AEBBB5DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422625006:0":{"text":"この人の言う通りよ。竜がいなくなったということは、恵の霊水がもらえなくなるんでしょ？","source_cn":"是啊，龙飞走了。那、那岂不是很快就没有恩典灵露了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568479BC7D8E435F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422625007:0":{"text":"あれがなかったら、私たちは、厄化して……ああ、私たちには霊水が必要なの！","source_cn":"没有了恩典灵露的我们，不就孽……我们不能没有恩典灵露！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB64B5D822FD2072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422625008:0":{"text":"ふむ……次はそちらの元貴族さん、何か言いたいことは？","source_cn":"那么这位前贵族大人，您也有话要说？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A2A06321A98937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422625009:0":{"text":"わ、私は、このままではいけないと思いまして……今や、あらゆる場所で、以前よりも遥かに多くの厄化が起きているのですよ！","source_cn":"我，我只知道现在这样不行！到处都是孽化，到处都……比、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58456AAF4BBB43AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422625010:1":{"text":"霊水の配布は止まっていないし、秩序もひとまずは保たれている。厄化が増えたという確実な報告はもらってないけどねえ。","source_cn":"现在灵露还在发放，基本秩序仍在维持。关于孽化增多的说法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37CDC092E0DFE2F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422625011:1":{"text":"そ、そんなはずはありません！","source_cn":"不不，不是这么回事，沙利叶大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92F2DBE2DAF95DC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422625012:1":{"text":"厄化が増えたのは本当です。それに発症までの期間も短くなっています！","source_cn":"周围孽化的人绝对多了，而且速度也更快了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1E397D6D9C6F302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422625013:1":{"text":"今と昔で唯一違うのは霊水の配給制度だ……はっ！？もしかして、霊水が厄化の原因なのか！？","source_cn":"现在跟之前唯一的区别是灵露配给制，该、该不会灵露才是孽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF75FD1D40310D92B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422625014:0":{"text":"ええ！？だったら、こんなもの、もう飲まないわ！私たちを地上へ行かせて！","source_cn":"那、那我不喝了，我要扔了它！放、放我们去地面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBED4480BF3FB9751","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422625015:0":{"text":"はいはい、落ち着いて！霊水もしまって。それを捨てたら、余計大変なことになるよ。","source_cn":"冷静！都冷静下来！先把灵露收好，丢弃它只会让情况更糟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1586B397221B7FA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422625016:0":{"text":"いいかい、キミたちの不安は分かるけど、こういうときだからこそ、疑うよりも、信頼し合うべきだ。","source_cn":"听着，我理解大家的恐惧，但这种时刻更需要团结而非互相猜疑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB24569BB5989EDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422625017:0":{"text":"竜が去ったことは、もう変えようのない事実だ。けど、残っている霊水だけでも――","source_cn":"龙的离开已成定局，但灵露的储备足够支撑一段时间——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C227934809024A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422625018:0":{"text":"少なくとも、ボクたちが一族の呪いを解く方法を見つけるまでは、十分持ちこたえられる。","source_cn":"支撑到我们找到解除一族诅咒的办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F0428A5F47ED30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1422625019:0":{"text":"厄化人が増えた件については、直ちに調べさせるよ。とにかく、今は慌てず、冷静になることが大事だ。","source_cn":"至于孽化者增多的事情，我会立即派人调查核实。保持镇定，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CDD9281A5C790F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1422625020:0":{"text":"それじゃ、そろそろ戻って、普段通りの生活を続けておくれ。ボクたちも、なるべく早く納得のいく答えが出せるよう頑張るからね。","source_cn":"现在，请大家回到各自的岗位上，继续维持正常生活。我保证...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BEB4CD99C098D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:140130112:0":{"text":"広場でエクシルたちに不満をぶつけられ、インドラが対応に困っていた。その時、サリエが駆けつけ、エクシルたちを宥めた。","source_cn":"广场上，艾塞勒们正对因度厄宣泄着不满，因度厄难以招架。...",